  "description": "C and C++ SDK for the KeyNub USB-C license dongle, for Visual Studio C++ projects: headers, import libraries and the prebuilt library for x64, x86 and ARM64. Verify authenticity, open an encrypted session, read and write license records, monotonic counters, app-data envelope encryption. Driverless on Windows. Referencing the package adds the include path, links the library and copies it next to the executable.",
